---
---
<section class="section manifesto-section fade-in" id="why-pagayo" aria-labelledby="why-pagayo-heading">
  <div class="container manifesto-container">
    <span class="section-label manifesto-label">
      Built on one idea
    </span>

    <h2 class="headline-lg manifesto-headline" id="why-pagayo-heading">
      A sale is a sale.
    </h2>

    <div class="manifesto-body">
      <p>
        It shouldn't matter whether someone bought online, paid at the counter,
        renewed a membership or had their access sponsored. To you, the person
        running the business, it's the same event. The same customer. The same
        number that needs to add up at the end of the day.
      </p>

      <p>
        Most software pretends otherwise. It splits your business into five
        products that don't agree, and then sells you a sixth one to glue them
        back together.
      </p>

      <p class="manifesto-emphasis">
        Pagayo is built around <strong>one Order</strong> — for every channel,
        every payer, every way money comes in.
      </p>

      <p>
        The webshop, the register, the subscriptions, the memberships, the
        sponsored access, the donations — they all share the same source of
        truth. So your numbers match. Your reports tell one story. And the
        software stays out of your way.
      </p>

      <p class="manifesto-close">
        That's the whole idea. Everything else follows from it.
      </p>

      <p class="manifesto-ideas">
        Got an idea or a feature you wish existed?
        <a href="/contact">Tell us — we read every one.</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .manifesto-container {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .manifesto-label {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .manifesto-headline {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .manifesto-body {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
  }

  .manifesto-body p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .manifesto-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .manifesto-emphasis {
    font-size: 1.375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text-primary, #f8fafc);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 2rem 0 !important;
  }

  .manifesto-emphasis strong {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand-primary, #6366f1), var(--brand-secondary, #06b6d4));
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .manifesto-close {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-primary, #f8fafc);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 2rem !important;
  }

  .manifesto-ideas {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary, #cbd5e1);
    margin-top: 1.5rem !important;
  }

  .manifesto-ideas a {
    color: var(--text-primary, #f8fafc);
    border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }

  .manifesto-ideas a:hover {
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .manifesto-section {
      padding-top: 3.5rem;
      padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    }
    .manifesto-body {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .manifesto-emphasis {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
    }
  }
</style>
